@Noodle_HostAddress = http://localhost:5090
@ApiKey = dev-api-key

### Upload a tarball (raw body, like curl --data-binary)
PUT {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/noodle/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./express-5.1.0.tgz

### Upload and wait until it is visible (no batching)
PUT {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/noodle/upload?wait=true
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./express-5.1.0.tgz

### Packument, abbreviated (what installs fetch)
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/express
Accept: application/vnd.npm.install-v1+json; q=1.0, application/json; q=0.8, */*

### Packument, full (npm view)
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/express
Accept: application/json

### Scoped package
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/@types%2fnode

### One version, or a dist-tag
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/express/5.1.0

###
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/express/latest

### Tarball
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/express/-/express-5.1.0.tgz

### dist-tags
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/package/express/dist-tags

### Set a dist-tag (the body is the version as a JSON string)
PUT {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/package/express/dist-tags/next
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

"5.1.0"

### Remove a dist-tag
DELETE {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/package/express/dist-tags/next
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}

### Search
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/v1/search?text=express&size=10

### Search with qualifiers
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/v1/search?text=keywords:framework%20not:unstable&size=10

### Audit (npm 7+)
POST {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/npm/v1/security/advisories/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{"lodash": ["4.17.15"]}

### Import security advisories (OSV, e.g. npm/all.zip from osv.dev)
PUT {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/noodle/advisories?source=osv-npm-all.zip
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./all.zip

### Delete a version (purge)
DELETE {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/noodle/package/express/5.1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}

### Rebuild the catalog from S3 (?scope=versions or ?scope=packuments for more)
POST {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/-/noodle/rebuild?wait=true
Authorization: Bearer {{ApiKey}}

### Health (advisory data status, counters) and readiness
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/health

###
GET {{Noodle_HostAddress}}/health/ready
